WEBVTT

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.217
into your chair and plunk yourself down

00:02:02.217 --> 00:02:04.505
on your back.

00:02:04.505 --> 00:02:08.453
And the hatch is closed,

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:10.600
and suddenly,

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:15.270
what has been a lifetime of both dreams and denial

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:16.725
is becoming real,

00:02:16.725 --> 00:02:17.798
something that I dreamed about,

00:02:17.798 --> 00:02:20.345
in fact, that I chose to do when I was nine years old,

00:02:20.345 --> 00:02:23.719
is now suddenly within not too many minutes

00:02:23.719 --> 00:02:25.577
of actually happening.

00:02:25.577 --> 00:02:28.260
In the astronaut business --

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.133
the shuttle is a very complicated vehicle;